  "description": "ASML Holding N.V. is a Dutch multinational corporation headquartered in Veldhoven, the Netherlands, that develops and manufactures photolithography machines for the semiconductor industry. The company operates in more than 60 locations worldwide and employs over 44,000 people (FTE) representing more than 80 nationalities. ASML provides chipmakers with hardware, software, and services, including advanced EUV and High-NA EUV lithography systems, and computational lithography solutions. The company is publicly traded on Euronext Amsterdam and NASDAQ under the symbol ASML. ASML serves the world's leading semiconductor manufacturers across Asia, the Americas, and Europe, with China business accounting for approximately 20% of total net sales in 2025.",
